# Publish an allowlist. All local research, caches and maintenance evidence stay local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/工作流使用指南.md
!/workflow搭建组件/
/workflow搭建组件/*
!/workflow搭建组件/发布包/
!/workflow搭建组件/发布工具/
/workflow搭建组件/发布包/**/__pycache__/
/workflow搭建组件/发布工具/**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
node_modules/
